The properties marked "fails" in main.c may be violated on hardware; all
others hold on hardware. The results were validated with qemu-arm, for A32
and T32 code compiled by GCC and Clang. "flags after add in divided syntax"
holds in A32 and T32 code, but is violated for Thumb-1 targets, where the add
sets the flags.
